.TH SOAP_SERVER.PY 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-downtime-logger 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
soap_server.py \- mock SOAP run\-control endpoint for the SoapDetector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python \-m tools.soap_server
.RB [ \-\-host
.IR HOST ]
.RB [ \-\-port
.IR PORT ]
.RB [ \-\-state
.IR VALUE ]
.br
.B python tools/soap_server.py
.I ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diagnostic tool shipped with
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1).
A single\-threaded stdlib
.B http.server
that serves a hand\-written WSDL declaring one operation,
.BR getRunState ,
whose response carries one string element,
.BR runState .
The value can be changed while the server runs.
.PP
The operation name, the
.B runState
field and the example
.B down_values
/
.B up_values
in
.I config/config.example.yaml
match this mock.
No other SOAP run\-control endpoint with this interface exists in the Mu2e
DAQ tree.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-host " HOST"
Bind address, also written into the WSDL service location.
Default
.BR 127.0.0.1 .
.TP
.BI \-\-port " PORT"
Listen port.
Default
.BR 8080 .
Other DAQ services, for example
.BR mu2edaq\-resource\-manager ,
also default to 8080; choose a free port on shared hosts.
.TP
.BI \-\-state " VALUE"
Initial
.BR runState .
Default
.BR Running .
The detector compares case\-insensitively against its
.B down_values
and
.BR up_values .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B GET /RunControl?wsdl
The WSDL.
Any
.B GET
whose query string is exactly
.B wsdl
returns it.
.TP
.BI "GET /set?state=" VALUE
Set
.B runState
and reply
.BI state= VALUE
as plain text.
.TP
.B POST
Any path: reply with a
.B getRunStateResponse
envelope carrying the current value.
The request body is read and ignored.
.TP
.B GET
Any other path: reply
.BI runState= VALUE
as plain text.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Stopped with Ctrl\-C.
.TP
.B 1
Bind failure (uncaught
.BR OSError ).
.TP
.B 2
Usage error.
.SH EXAMPLES
Serve on a free port and flip the state:
.PP
.RS
.nf
python \-m tools.soap_server \-\-port 18080 \-\-state Running
curl 'http://127.0.0.1:18080/set?state=Stopped'
curl 'http://127.0.0.1:18080/RunControl?wsdl'
.fi
.RE
.PP
Matching detector block:
.PP
.RS
.nf
\- id: soap_mock
  plugin: downtime_logger.detectors.soap_detector:SoapDetector
  options:
    wsdl: "http://127.0.0.1:18080/RunControl?wsdl"
    operation: getRunState
    state_path: runState
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger\-api (7),
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger.yaml (5)
